WEBVTT

00:00:00.353 --> 00:00:01.043
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.369 --> 00:00:04.988
<v><b>A:</b></v> Would you like to come to a party at my house?

00:00:08.904 --> 00:00:11.508
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes, I’d love to. Thanks!

00:00:15.744 --> 00:00:16.517
When is it?

00:00:18.930 --> 00:00:20.594
<v><b>A:</b></v> It’s on Friday at 8.00.

00:00:23.469 --> 00:00:25.375
<v><b>B:</b></v> Great! See you there.

00:00:28.334 --> 00:00:28.934
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:30.329 --> 00:00:32.697
<v><b>A:</b></v> Would you like to come to a party on Saturday?

00:00:35.869 --> 00:00:37.604
<v><b>B:</b></v> Sorry, I can’t.

00:00:40.281 --> 00:00:42.173
I’m busy on Saturday night.